[I] Unofficial API for YouTube Music

[T] ytmusicapi is a Python 3 library to send requests to the YouTube Music API.
[T] It emulates YouTube Music web client requests using the user's cookie data
[T] for authentication.

[U] https://github.com/sigma67/ytmusicapi

